# openHC feature: zwave — the Z-Wave to MQTT bridge, zwave-bridge
# (github.com/pulzar-net/zwave-bridge), on the board's Serial API controller:
# an onboard module (the CA-1's ZM5304, tagged by the board's udev rule) or a
# USB stick (61-openhc-zwave.rules). Nothing from Buildroot: the bridge is one
# static binary, built by packages/build.sh from this feature's `packages`, and
# talks to the box's mosquitto (common_defconfig).
#
# Its device library is Z-Wave JS's device database, installed as data
# (packages/zwave-js-config): it names each node and its parameters.
BR2_PACKAGE_ZWAVE_JS_CONFIG=y
